          "short": "$220\\text{ m}$",
          "worked": "The four walking distances are $40\\text{ m}$, $10\\text{ m}$, $70\\text{ m}$ and $100\\text{ m}$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}-10-(-50)&=40\\\\-10-(-20)&=10\\\\50-(-20)&=70\\\\50-(-50)&=100\\end{aligned}$$\nTurning adds no distance. The total distance walked is\n$$40+10+70+100=220\\text{ m}.$$",
